    "Duchy of Drusavia": {
      "name": "Duchy of Drusavia",
      "basicInfo": "The Duchy of Drusavia is old, green hill country of forested slopes and rich farming dales under weather that runs to mist and low cloud, with the fog lying in the valley bottoms of a morning. It is a settled, prosperous land of villages, mills, and old estates — and it is haunted. Its capital also draws wealthy moon elf houses whose magic, patronage, and old rivalries make them a visible power among the city's nobles. The dead of a bad age rise in the dales by night, while the Templars Adamant and the Shadow Inquisition disagree on whether the answer is to seal the dead away or enter their country and fight them at the source. No one travels after dark.",
