      "basicInfo": "Carendon is an old, prosperous kingdom of forested hills, low mountains, rivers, walled towns, and hunting estates grown rich on timber, fur, and game. It is gracious country, all old families and older castles, but the woods press close and breed things soldiers cannot handle: beasts too large, too cunning, or too strange to leave alone. Carendon's peace depends on keeping those monsters culled. This is the seat of the Order of the Silver Sword, the Silverblades, who hunt with radiant metal that bites what ordinary steel cannot.",
