      "x": 1,
      "y": 0,
      "realm": "Larion",
      "known": true,
      "basicInfo": "The Dunelands are a vast desert under a white and merciless sun, where dunes run to the horizon and the wind reshapes the land overnight. At its heart, deep springs feed Oasis, the palm-green white city in a country of sand, stone, and bone. Beyond the water stand the pyramids of the old Sun Kings, still rich with buried gold and whatever was set to guard it. Tomb-crews cross the heat to dig, and the desert takes its share. Djinnborn, jackalkin, desert elves, and other desert peoples live by spring, caravan road, ruin, and hidden camp, keeping old customs and making hard bargains under the long sun.",
