      "x": 1,
      "y": 1,
      "realm": "Larion",
      "known": true,
      "basicInfo": "Redrock is red badland country: deep canyons, wind-carved mesas, burned cities, and a hard sun, rising northward into cool peaks above the clouds. It was rich once, before demons came and its people burned their own cities in the magic that drove them back. The land never recovered. The low places still smolder, and demons claw up after dark, so travelers race the sun to the next barred door. Danger is worst on the canyon floors, among ruins, raider-held cities, and old burn-scars; high above, where the air is cool and thin, the cities are safer and their people live well.",
