    "Great Lagoon": {
      "name": "Great Lagoon",
      "basicInfo": "The Great Lagoon is a country of tidal shallows and reed-marsh on the southern coast, and the seat of the Empire of Light. Its capital stands on ground reclaimed from the lagoon, and over the city floats the Eye of God, an enormous citadel of gold-bright brass tethered in the sky. The empire takes citizens of every people and hires soldiers of every kind, and it is the strongest and most dangerous power in the south. West of the city its war grinds into the deep fens, where the marsh belongs to a hostile lizardfolk kingdom and its dragon.",
