      "y": -1,
      "realm": "Larion",
      "known": true,
      "basicInfo": "The Reedmoot Fens are a vast saltwater marsh peninsula — reed-flats, mangrove, black water, and drowned ruins under a low wet sky. The Fens once traded with the world; now they are closed. A dragon rose from the brood-mounds within living memory, the lizardfolk clans united behind her as a kingdom, and that kingdom kills or takes any outsider found in its territory. Only the eastern strip stays open ground, where free villages hold their walls against the fen and the wetland's older peoples keep their own places.",
