    "Ntar Vanna": {
      "name": "Ntar Vanna",
      "basicInfo": "Ntar Vanna is the great river jungle of the southern world, built along the Saranadi as it runs from the deep interior to the sea. The river is the only road through it, and the farther upriver you go, the wilder the country gets. This is hot, rainy, misted land where trees rise like towers, undergrowth swallows roads in days, and beasts grow larger than anything in the outer world. Many proud peoples share the river and no crown rules them all: demonborn at the great port-city of the mouth, monkeyfolk, elephantfolk, serpentkin, frogkin, and others holding their own stretches upriver, trading, feuding, and bargaining as the river carries everything between them.",
