      "x": 0,
      "y": -2,
      "realm": "Larion",
      "known": true,
      "basicInfo": "The Swordlaw Isles are a scatter of green islands in a warm southern sea, strung together by the colossal stone bridges left behind by a fallen empire — mile-long spans that vault from isle to isle, half-sunk where the sea has taken them. Most isles are lawless, home to freebooters and privateers, and quarrels are settled by the Swordlaw: steel decides, and the winner's word stands. One proud dukedom holds the bridged heart of the isles under its own law and hunts the pirates beyond it; past its reach, the open water belongs to whoever is strong enough to hold it.",
