    "Bay of Serpents": {
      "name": "Bay of Serpents",
      "x": 1,
      "y": -2,
      "realm": "Larion",
      "known": true,
      "basicInfo": "The Bay of Serpents is a warm southern sea of bright water, green islands, white beaches, and reefs like sunken gardens. The southern shipping lanes cross here, and so do the richest monster waters in Larion: sea serpents, leviathans, and stranger things drawn by the currents. Coriva, the great hunting port, grew rich killing the monsters that threaten the lanes; its hunters are celebrities, and its craftsmen turn scale, bone, oil, and hide into goods known across the coast. The same waters hold merfolk lagoon-villages, floating raft-towns, and drakerider isles where sea-drakes carry riders over open water.",
