      "y": -3,
      "realm": "Larion",
      "known": true,
      "basicInfo": "The Seadeep Kingdoms are open ocean over drowned country — the storm-dark southern sea where Orichala, greatest city of the old empire, sank in a single night, and where merfolk kingdoms rule everything beneath the surface. Ships may cross if they keep moving. Stop to take what the sea has claimed, set foot on the drowned places, or pry at the wrecks, and the kingdoms answer from below. Sailors cross Seadeep water without stopping, and count themselves lucky to have crossed it.",
