    "Darek Deep": {
      "name": "Darek Deep",
      "basicInfo": "The Darek Deep is a dead subterranean city far below Deepgate, built by the vanished dareks, pale dwarf-like elders who left behind halls of stone and iron, dead machines, and treasure beyond counting. Their constructs still move in the dark, soul-stones burning inside them, guarding posts for masters long gone and crying the old warning that gave the Deep its name: Dar-Ek. Crews descend the great shaft for black iron, construct parts, soul-stones, and other salvage of a lost age. The upper halls are picked over and quieter; deeper down, the guardians still keep faith with the dead, and morlocks haunt the dark between.",
