      "basicInfo": "The Tarnished Reaches are a province of the Shadelands, the grey realm of the dead and unborn, where the land takes shape from the memories of those who refuse to pass on. Here linger the highborn dead of the Fourth Empire: lords and kings who served the demon-princes of Ur and will not cross the River Repenthe to be unmade. Baroque palaces, fallen capitals, and ruined courts crumble under a starless sky, proud and cruel even in death. At their heart stands Lord Rhadan's Court, the one fixed and guarded place in the Reaches.",
