      "x": -2,
      "y": 2,
      "known": true,
      "basicInfo": "The Rootdark is the dark-elf realm beneath the Elfwood: a vast cavern-country lit by the Root-sky, glowing roots that hang amber to violet across the dark. At its heart stands Maanvalta, the dark-elf capital, built around the World-root where it descends into the World-spring. Beyond the capital, tunnel-roads run through outlying holds, deep markets, old ruins, and guarded ways where the dark elves keep watch. It is beautiful, wealthy, and dangerous: a whole underworld kingdom beneath the forest, open to bold surfacers at its gates and lethal to fools who wander from the road.",
