    "Wardcoast": {
      "name": "Wardcoast",
      "basicInfo": "Wardcoast is where the Everwood comes down to the sea: old woodland thinning to heath and pasture, grey cliffs, and one sheltered cove that has been a landing since before anyone kept records. A ring of elven ward-stones stands in a clearing above it, still keeping something out. The cove is the only way into the deep wood that does not pass a gate, which is why smugglers and worse know it.",
