            }
          }
        },
        "Watchtower - Portal Hall": {
          "description": "The top hall of the Watchtower, ringed with elderstone daises keyed to named destinations. Lit daises are realms and institutions that keep a portal here and work with the League. Anyone may walk up and pay the toll; League members pay less. Destinations: Tarnholme Academy of the Arcane at Jade Tarn, Castle Harstone in Carendon, the Black Tower in Drusavia, and the Citadel of the Pact in Redrock.",
