        "The Way of Coin": {
          "description": "The commercial spine of the city: banks, countinghouses, jewelers, auction rooms, guild offices, and merchant houses with painted doors and guarded ledgers. Flamboyant merchant-princes hold parties no one important misses. Some are merely rich. Some are Syndicate money wearing better gloves.",
