        },
        "The Sacred Way": {
          "description": "A long terrace of temples, shrines, holy houses, enchanters, alchemists, charmwrights, reagent sellers, and sellers of blessed gear. Priests bless oaths, hear trouble, sell charms and consecrated oil, and prepare radiant tools for work among the dead. The House of First Light, chief temple of the Lady of Hope and seat of the Order of the Dawn, keeps the sacred fire from which fallen shrines throughout Larion are rekindled. The great domed Two Rivers Bathhouse stands here too, fed by the city's rivers. Funeral processions for the wealthy pass along the Sacred Way toward the City of Ancestors, stopping at the Shrine of the Grey Lady.",
