        },
        "The Crooked Cellar": {
          "description": "A hidden den beneath a shuttered Old Town tenement, reached through a false wine rack and a complicated lock. The brick vault is low, dry, and just large enough for a new crew: mismatched chairs, sleeping pallets, a scarred table, wall hooks for cloaks and tools, and a small hearth whose smoke disappears into a forgotten flue. The room has no public sign and only one mapped route out, back up into Old Town.",
          "paths": [
