        "Champion's Row": {
          "description": "A row of grand townhouses overlooking the rivers from the High City's edge. Each belongs to a Champion of Larion. At the head of the row stands the Temple of Champions, a vast domed chamber. Within it, the sealed Council Chamber where the Council of Champions sits and Ardan's tomb lies.",
