      "basicInfo": "A village built around hotsprings that never freeze, where folk from across the highlands come to soak wounds, ease old bones, and conduct business. The Tethwell family has maintained the springs for twelve generations and enforces an absolute rule: disputes stay outside. Whether the waters actually heal or just provide rest and respite, nobody leaves unchanged.",
