        "The Yard": {
          "description": "An open space behind the fort where the nanukin train and contest — grappling, charging, running formations in their armor. The ground is packed ice, worn smooth and rutted by heavy use. Trophies of past raids and hunts stand on poles driven into the frozen ground.",
          "paths": [
