        "Lakebottom": {
          "description": "The lowest tier, where the Waterdrop lifts come down to land at stone piers reaching into Lake Two-Waters. Skyriver Waterfall thunders down from the Eye far overhead, throwing mist across the water. From here the whole city rises in carved rings — Lakebottom, the Market Ring, the Craft Ring, the Farm Ring, the High Ring. Fishing boats bob at the piers and dwarves swim in the cold water year-round. A rope-ferry crosses to an island at the lake's center, staircases wind up to the Market Ring, and the Wetted Whistle inn dominates the shore.",
