        "The Wetted Whistle": {
          "description": "A sprawling tavern built into the cavern wall at Lakebottom, its front terrace half out over the water, perpetually loud and perpetually full. The Trade Guild owns it and runs its business from the upper floors. A work-board by the door is crowded with postings from the city and the surface roads — lift crews being shaken down, valuable Craft Ring work stolen to order, false clan tolls, crooked factors, and caravan routes being bled. The hardest road notices carry blunt warnings; anything pointing toward troll-held Varric's Span is work for a proven crew, not a casual first outing. Crews form at the tables, deals are struck over ale, and veterans tell newcomers which jobs will pay and which will kill them.",
