        "The Deep End": {
          "description": "The delvers' tavern, built right on the lip of the crater, one whole side open to the drop where a rail lets a drinker lean out and watch the cages go down and come up. Rooms upstairs, hot food, cold drink, and someone always playing something loud over the din of a hundred crews. The veterans who have lived through a delve hold court at the good tables, and the green and the desperate buy them drinks for what they know. The tavern runs its own hoist down into the crater, a private cage for those who can pay.",
