        "The Old Keep": {
          "description": "A stone keep on the high ground above the town, the only proper building in a place thrown up from timber — some old mountain watchtower, long abandoned and now seized and held. Greloq's Company flies its flag from the tower, and light spills from every window after dark while the rest of Deepgate sleeps. Hard-eyed crews in the best gear on the rim come and go from its gates, and the townsfolk give the place a wide berth and speak of it low.",
