        "The Pit-Stair": {
          "description": "The mouth of the crater, where the descent into the dark begins — a ring of hoist-towers and heavy winches around the rim, cages and rope-stairs running down past the broken, tilted halls of fallen Stonehome toward the elder dark below. Crews check their weapons and ward-charms at the head of the descent, and a worn shrine-post stands at the lip where the going-down touch it for luck. Far down through the gap, the dead city's stonework gives way to older, stranger work, and the cold breathes up out of the deep.",
