        "Brightlights": {
          "description": "An open-air rooftop bar high on the Promenade, the city laid out glowing below and the storm-towers near above. A bound lightning-spirit shifts color and brightness through the railings and glassware to match the music. Deep chairs, low tables, and a long bar make it a place to drink, talk, and be seen between the tables.",
          "paths": [
            "The Promenade"
          ]
        },
        "The Tower of Fortune": {
          "description": "The grandest of the five Houses, a tall hall of marble and dark wood rising over the Promenade and glowing blue at its height. The ground floor is open play; the stairs climb past richer and quieter rooms to the high tables at the top, where the city's serious money sits.",
          "paths": [
