        "The Gilded Cage": {
          "description": "A multi-story ring of galleries built around a great ornate iron cage, where armed bouts, unarmed matches, and fights against penned beasts are staged for the wagering crowd. The galleries climb from the pit-rail to private boxes near the roof. Weapon racks, holding pens, and a fighters' under-gallery ring the cage floor. Its declared championship is recognized on the Grand Arena Circuit, with the five Houses competing to sponsor proven fighters.",
          "paths": [
