        "The Spirit Hearth": {
          "description": "A round, open-roofed shrine of standing stones behind the training yard, centered on a low fire fed with herbs, carved tokens, and offerings brought from across the Wolds. Wolfpack shamans keep watch but do not command what answers. Proven Hunters come here voluntarily to seek a beast-spirit whose nature accords with their own; the rite succeeds only when hunter and spirit both accept the bond.",
