    "Whitehill Kobold Warren": {
      "name": "Whitehill Kobold Warren",
      "basicInfo": "A network of tunnels and crude fortifications dug into a rocky hillside. Kobolds have infested this place for generations, but recently they've become organized — patrols, watch-posts, even a gate.",
      "hiddenInfo": "A goblin expeditionary squad from the Greater Goblinate has taken command of the warren, 'recruiting' the local kobolds into the empire's service. The goblin captain sees the warren as a forward outpost — a foothold in Whitecliff Downs far from Goblinate territory. The kobolds are split: some welcome the weapons, training, and sense of purpose; others resent taking orders from outsiders who treat them as expendable labor. The captain has also been sending kobold scouts to map the Downs' trade roads — preparation for something bigger. The whole operation is small enough to go unnoticed for now, which is exactly how the Goblinate prefers to work.",
