          "description": "A grand tavern-barge drifting the canals, its musicians and callers inviting the city aboard. Lanterns sway from silk canopies over a deck packed with drinkers off every quay. Below deck are private cabins, hired by the hour for talk that the open deck is too loud and too public to hold.",
