        "The Last Stand Tavern": {
          "description": "Built into Westgate Tower, where the city's defenders held the line in the Kindred War. Trophies from legendary kills hang beneath the Great Bell, which still rings when something tests the wards out in the wood. The best tables face the windows over the Everwood, and the drinkers who take them are the ones who go out into it - hunters, rangers, and other adventurers.",
