          "description": "A narrow street of smithies and armories sloping toward the heavy clan-carved doors of the Underhalls, the ring of hammers steady from before dawn. Dwarven smiths and gnome tinkers work the fronts side by side, and the goods on show run from plain steel to the work the wood demands - cold iron, hammered without fire, the grey metal whose touch the fey cannot abide.",
