        "The Greenwarren": {
          "description": "A winding maze of halfling terrace-mounds, each level joined to the next by paths and shortcuts only locals know. Behind the round doors lie trading offices, snug taverns, and the produce markets that feed half the city. It is the one quarter that feels unhurried, and the halflings will tell you at length that it is also the only civilized one.",
