        "The Char": {
          "description": "A whole block gutted by fire and left to rot, its streets barricaded at both ends and the Watch posted to turn people back. Whatever lives in the ruins now is not friendly, and the sounds that carry out of it after dark keep the neighboring lanes empty till morning. No one agrees on what burned it, or on what moved into the ashes after.",
