      "complexityType": "complex",
      "basicInfo": "Hillhome is a halfling village built into the gentle hills of Whitecliff Downs, where round doors and grass roofs peek from every slope and gardens fill the dells between them. Children and dogs run loose, neighbors call across the lanes, doors stand open, and not knowing someone's name is downright rude.",
