        "The Silver Bough": {
          "description": "A tavern and inn built where three silverleaf trunks grow close together, their branches forming a natural platform a hundred feet up. The common room wraps around all three trunks, open-sided. The drinks are excellent. The company is better - off-duty High Wardens, traders up from Greenshade, elven artisans, and the occasional outsider who's earned a regular seat. The best source of news and rumor in the city.",
