        "The Warden Hall": {
          "description": "Headquarters of the High Wardens, built around a massive branch of the First Tree. Armories, planning chambers, quarters for Wardens between assignments. A board posts the forest's current troubles - beasts on the move, the elf renegades harrying the human and orc borders, the open crossing into the dark elf underworld at Ilunethel and what passes through it, the burned ground in the east. The incursion reports out of the deep run worst in the valleys near Adamant.",
