        "The Academy of Greenshaping": {
          "description": "Where the high elves study their two oldest arts: greenshaping, the magic of growing and persuading living wood that raised the city itself, and the wardcraft that binds and protects it. Chambers grown from living trees house libraries of pressed-leaf books, workshops where saplings are coaxed into walls and stairs, and quiet gardens for the slow work of warding. High elf students spend decades here before they are reckoned merely competent. Outsider mages of genuine talent can petition for a guest residency - the masters are selective, but the art grows nowhere else in Larion.",
