        "The High Boughs": {
          "description": "Three hundred feet up, where the noble houses keep their estates among the upper branches. The architecture is less built than shaped - walls of living bark, floors of woven branch, windows shaped gaps between them. The Council of Elf-Lords meets in a chamber grown from the First Tree itself. The lords here are old beyond counting, and among such company there is always one quietly weighing the long road to Eanleana, the Final City, where elves who have wearied of their years go to an honorable end.",
