        "The Spokes": {
          "description": "The main habitable area — a network of silk platforms stretched between tree trunks a hundred feet up, strong enough to hold a dozen people, swaying gently. The silk is translucent in daylight and faintly luminous at night. Spinners move freely across vertical and horizontal surfaces.",
          "paths": [
