    "The Wildmarket": {
      "name": "The Wildmarket",
      "basicInfo": "A sprawling trading ground in the northern reaches of Whitecliff Downs, near the forested border with Carendon. The roads from the Downs end here at rough country thick with monsters. Hunters, monster-slayers, trappers, guides, and merchants gather under the trees. What respectable towns won't buy or sell moves here: monster parts, forest products, fey-touched goods, unlicensed charms, salvaged relics, and work too dangerous for a crown-licensed board. The market spreads through clearings and beneath old trees, stalls and blankets and shouting merchants, dawn to dusk only - traders who linger past sunset take their chances with whatever hunts the border wood. No guards, no law, no protection. The traders police themselves, badly. Everyone needs this place to exist, so everyone tolerates its chaos.",
      "hiddenInfo": "This is an unofficial frontier exchange in the northern reaches of Whitecliff Downs, close to the forested border with Carendon. Independent monster hunters, trappers, guides, caravaners, and fixers pass through. Hunters sell claws, hides, venom, teeth, trophies, and proof of kills; crews buy silvered gear, bait, medicines, maps, and news of what is moving in the woods. The deeper clearings are where unlicensed work, monster-related contraband, fey-touched goods, and dangerous bargains change hands. If you need a guide into the border wood, a crew for a bounty, or work that will never appear on an official board, this is where you come.",
      "x": 14,
      "y": 39,
      "radius": 1,
      "region": "Whitecliff Downs",
      "complexityType": "complex",
      "detailType": "detailed",
      "areas": {
        "Roadside": {
          "description": "The market's edge nearest the road north toward Carendon, where the forested border is visible through the trees. Established merchants set up here - sturdy stalls, familiar goods, and a quick retreat toward the settled roads if trouble starts. The safest part of the market, which isn't saying much.",
          "paths": [
            "The Trading Ground"
          ]
        },
        "The Trading Ground": {
          "description": "The market's chaotic heart. Blankets spread with monster hides, dried herbs, venom vials, teeth, silver fittings, and craft-work. Hunters haggle over provisions and gear while merchants shout across a dozen deals, every one of them someone's livelihood.",
          "paths": [
