          ]
        },
        "The Satyr Stands": {
          "description": "Wine stalls and tavern-tents where satyrs and other border regulars pour drinks that range from merely strong to genuinely dangerous. Music, dice games, gossip. If you want to know what's happening in the woods - or find someone who knows someone who can help with a problem - buy a round and start talking.",
          "paths": [
