        "The Training Yards": {
          "description": "The cleared ground and root-galleries around the oak's base where initiates are made into Wildkeepers - run through forms with blade and bow, taught the wood's beasts and the wood's poisons, set to spar against those further along.",
          "paths": [
            "The Hollow Hall"
