        "The Qamarid Palace": {
          "description": "The palace of the Qamarid Princes: soaring towers and water gardens defying the desert heat, fountains running day and night, peacocks on the lawns. Petitioners queue in the outer courts; the inner sanctums open only to rank, favor, or invitation. Guards in Qamarid colors keep the palace itself — the one ground in the city the Red-cowls do not patrol.",
