        "The Red Sands": {
          "description": "A great sand-floored arena of tiered stone seating, open to the sky, where the city's fighters meet before roaring crowds. Beneath the stands run training halls and fighters' cells, where scimitar, spear, and the sand-dancer styles are taught and drilled. The fights run from cheap daily bouts to the great matches that draw the whole city, and a winning fighter can make a name fast. Its declared championship is recognized on the Grand Arena Circuit.",
