        "Skyweavers' Lane": {
          "description": "A narrow, prosperous street of grand workshop-houses hung with carpets in the windows and across the upper galleries, the home of the families who weave and enchant the flying carpets Oasis is famous for. Looms stand at work behind the open fronts, and finished carpets, plain and patterned, are shown and sold within. Other enchanters keep shops along the lane in the families' shadow, working charms and wards.",
