          "description": "An airy hall opening off the Caravanserai, with carved sandstone pillars and striped awnings shading its courtyard. Tomb-raiders, desert scouts, and visiting adventurers gather over mint tea around tables scattered with maps and sketches of recovered treasures. Expedition notices hang beside a great map of the desert, and sand-worn shields and sun-gold ornaments line the walls.",
