    "The Lodge of the Wind Dancers": {
      "name": "The Lodge of the Wind Dancers",
      "complexityType": "complex",
      "basicInfo": "The Lodge of the Wind Dancers sits among towering natural rock pillars where desert winds create powerful, swirling currents. Simple stone buildings shelter against the rocks while the spaces between pillars form natural training grounds where initiates learn the spinning blade techniques of the Whirling Path. The Lodge trains dervishes in paired scimitars, trance meditation, and the art of fighting in perfect flow with motion and wind.",
      "hiddenInfo": "The masters guard a secret: in the deepest trance state, the most skilled dervishes don't just sense attacks coming - they can see a few heartbeats into the future. This isn't magic but heightened awareness achieved through motion, meditation, and the wind's teaching. The Lodge accepts any with coin and dedication, but only those with true commitment reach the deeper mysteries. Recently, several students went on vision quests into the deep desert and haven't returned.",
      "x": -7,
      "y": -24,
      "radius": 1,
      "region": "Dunelands",
      "detailType": "detailed",
      "areas": {
