        },
        "The Lodgehouses": {
          "description": "Simple stone dwellings built against the rock faces, providing shelter from the harsh desert sun and sandstorms. Sleeping quarters are sparse - just mats and storage for personal belongings. A communal area serves meals and provides space for rest between training sessions. The forge sits in an open courtyard here, where smiths craft and balance paired scimitars for each dervish.",
          "paths": [
