        },
        "The Masters' Chambers": {
          "description": "Private quarters carved into the largest rock pillar, accessible only by a steep climb. Here the senior dervishes keep their chambers and guard the Lodge's deeper secrets. A small library contains scrolls documenting the Whirling Path's techniques and philosophy. Only advanced students are permitted entry.",
