        "The Cloudwing Landing": {
          "description": "Tiered ledges cling to the tallest red spire, with broad landing platforms, cargo slings, passenger benches, and sheltered perches for the Temple's cloudwing condors. Handlers bring in visitors, supplies, injured trainees, and wealthy travelers who would rather fly than climb. The great birds launch into the open sky from here, wheeling around the floating mountain before vanishing into the cloud-sea.",
