        "The Joyful Refectory": {
          "description": "The Refectory is an open-sided hall cut into a red-rock canyon wall, its long tables overlooking the clouds. Hearths, brewing vats, kitchens, potion benches, music platforms, and shelves of mismatched cups keep the place warm, loud, and welcoming. The Temple serves hearty food, strong drink, restorative tonics, and training draughts. Monks argue philosophy over breakfast, celebrate successful Descents over dinner, and cheerfully retell one another's most humiliating falls.",
