        "The Practice Heights": {
          "description": "The Practice Heights spread across several red-rock spires connected by narrow bridges, rope swings, suspended rings, running channels, landing pillars, and strips of shallow water. Students learn to detune their bodies until they become light enough to run along walls or leap impossible distances, then attune themselves to land, anchor, and strike with tremendous force. Teachers call corrections from the platforms while friends shout encouragement, advice, and occasionally unhelpful wagers. The Catching Winds move through the gaps unseen until a fall becomes truly lethal.",
