        "The Hall of Breath": {
          "description": "The Hall of Breath is a high study hall lined with wind-cut columns, low desks, hanging diagrams, copied teachings, training records, and maps of the wider world. Instructors teach concentration, body awareness, physical attunement, recovery, compassion, and the history of the First Adept. Accounts from past Descents hang beside current requests for aid, giving ambitious students a glimpse of the work expected beyond the mountain. Lessons frequently become arguments, demonstrations, or invitations to attempt a difficult movement before a student feels ready.",
