        },
        "The Steady Hand Inn": {
          "description": "Where craftspeople drink after long days. Built by carpenters showing off their skills - carved and inlaid woodwork covers almost every surface. The food is hearty, portions generous. Conversations center on commissions, techniques, apprentices. Brawls over craft quality are common but rarely serious.",
          "paths": [
