    "Greenmeadow": {
      "name": "Greenmeadow",
      "complexityType": "complex",
      "basicInfo": "Greenmeadow is a lively farming village in Silvervale's low hills, gathered beneath the Summer Oak, an immense tree that remains green through winter and lends the surrounding country an unusual abundance. Above the fields stands Meadowcourt, an elegant keep belonging to House Edevane, an eccentric but respected sorcerous family famed for raising hippogriffs.",
      "hiddenInfo": "Most of Greenmeadow's permanent residents are human, with a few halfling and gnome households among them. Visitors drawn to Meadowcourt bring a wider range of peoples, fashions, and magical traditions.\n\nHouse Edevane has produced sorcerers for generations. Their gifts differ from one family member to another, but their confidence with magic and long practice with magical creatures have made Meadowcourt's High Aerie one of the few places in Larion that breeds and trains hippogriffs. The family keeps only a small number. Noble households travel here to purchase a young hippogriff, arrange a breeding, or learn how to handle and ride one. House Edevane is considered unusual, fashionable, and capable rather than dangerous.",
