          "description": "A compact equipment market on the upper road between the village and Meadowcourt, serving local adventurers, household retainers, visiting riders, and travelers preparing for difficult journeys. Its permanent shops include a bowyer and fletcher, an armorer and weaponsmith, an outfitter selling durable clothing and travel gear, a glass-fronted alchemist's shop, and a master saddler who makes ordinary riding tack as well as the light saddles, safety lines, and fitted harness used with hippogriffs.\n\nThis is an equipment market rather than a produce market. Its useful stock includes weapons, armor, bows, arrows, clothing, potions, medicines, riding equipment, and flight tack.",
