        "The Fields": {
          "description": "Long fields of wheat, barley, beans, and flax lie between vegetable plots and sheep pasture. The land is generous, but planting and harvest still demand every available hand. After work, the broad tracks and open margins become places for running, archery, practice, picnics, and whatever competition someone can persuade everyone else to attempt.",
