      "hiddenInfo": "Seat of a minor noble line with roots three centuries deep. The estate's wealth comes from the vineyard, tenant farms in Willowford village, and river trade. Ashbury Hall on the western hill is the nearest noble neighbor—relations have varied over the generations. The old Fallen Chapel near the grounds predates the manor itself, built over something older still.",
