        "The Hearth": {
          "description": "The ground-floor room, kitchen and sitting room in one, with mismatched chairs, a fire always burning, and tea-things forever in use. Manuscripts have colonized every surface, volucats doze on the shelves, and a narrow spiral stair winds up at the back.",
          "paths": [
