        "The Scriptorium": {
          "description": "The upper floor, dominated by three writing-desks where enchanted quills scratch away on their own in three hands at once, and by the tottering stacks of the History of Undiscovered Realms rising on every side. A battered dictation-chair sits at the center of it all. When someone enters, the quills pause with their nibs lifted, as though listening.",
          "paths": [
