        "Shadowside": {
          "description": "The city proper, climbing the north-facing wall in terraces joined by steep stairs and winding streets. No sunlight reaches here, ever. Mage-lights in caged silver give a cold illumination, and the architecture is black stone inlaid with silver and obsidian, elegant and imposing. Moon elf homes, businesses, and social halls fill these streets, and gnomish shops sell fine craftwork — silver, glass, jewelry of remarkable delicacy. On one quiet street stands the Crescent House, unmarked, kept by House Kaeris: nothing sits on display, but a caller who states what they want is given a name, a price, or a closed door, whether the want is blood magic, a bound creature, or the silver and moonstone weapons that bite the curse. Outsiders walk Shadowside freely, but the city watches, and lingering too long in the wrong place draws the wrong eyes.",
