        "The Silverer's": {
          "description": "A forge on the Sunside slope above the market, its doors open to the light and its yard stacked with billets under lock. This is where the valley's silver is worked — blades, arrowheads, grille-bars, the silvered edge on a billhook — and there is a waiting list, because the mountain does not stop and neither does the demand. A licence hangs framed by the door in a hand six hundred years old, signed by the lady of this valley, permitting the making of the one metal that can kill her. Moonstone work is done at the back and goes to the Crimson Company. Anyone with the coin can buy here, and nobody's rank moves them up the list.",
