        "The Wallows": {
          "description": "A broad, shallow stretch of river where the bank has been shaped into gentle mud slopes. The water runs brown and slow past the reeds. Plank walkways cross the softest ground, and low mud-brick buildings stand back from the waterline.",
          "paths": [
            "The River Gate",
            "The Long Table"
