        "The Long Table": {
          "description": "A communal eating hall, open-sided, built around a single table that seats a hundred, with a row of fire-pits down one side worked by boarfolk cooks. Benches line both sides of the table the whole length of the hall. The roof is mud-brick and thatch, and the channel runs close enough to hear from the benches.",
          "paths": [
