          "description": "A grand public square paved in reclaimed marble, ringed by colonnades and open to the sky, with the Eye hanging bright overhead. A dais stands at one end for proclamations and public audience; a great noticeboard near it posts the empire's edicts, work-levies, and standing bounties on the swamp-creatures and outlaws that trouble the lagoon. Causeways and canal-streets run off the square into the city.",
