          "description": "A round court at the heart of the ruined palace, and the only safe ground in the Shadelands. A single shaft of cold light falls from the black clouds overhead into the center of the court — the Beacon, the way in and the way home. A hunter crossing from the Pit of Shadow arrives here; to return, stand in the light and will it. Broken colonnades ring the court, and beyond them the palace climbs into ruin and nothing. Shades do not enter here. The Hound sees to that — a black three-headed mastiff, vast and bound to the light, that devours any dead thing crossing the threshold uninvited. It lets the living pass. Its three heads are constantly scanning for interlopers.",
