        "The Avenue of Triumphs": {
          "description": "The great processional artery running west through the city's heart — a drowned boulevard lined with triumphal arches and toppled colossal statues. The water is waist-deep, the sightlines run far, and there is nowhere to hide.",
          "paths": [
