        "The Black Water": {
          "description": "The marsh proper — a maze of slow black channels, reed-islands, and drowned stumps, the bad fords and the deep meres where the drowners lurk. Wisp-lights drift over the water at dusk, and the way is easy to lose.",
          "paths": [
