        "The Reaver Camp": {
          "description": "A reaver camp back in the trees off the road, wherever the band that holds the road this season has made it — a rough huddle of lean-tos and a fire, the loot of the latest takes, lookouts on the trails in, and the leader who runs it. The camps move and change hands as the crown breaks them and new men take the road, but there is always one.",
          "paths": [
            "The Road"
          ]
        }
