        "The Two Banks": {
          "description": "Named for the view across the river toward Sanctuary Vale. Waldgate's inn, built around a common room with a long hearth. Woodcutters, half-elf traders, the occasional wood elf, and travelers crossing at the ford. Sanctuary Vale goods on the tables — forest herbs, dyes, elven leatherwork. The Westmarch Ranger posted at the ford drinks here and knows everyone who crosses.",
          "paths": [
            "Waldgate Green"
          ]
        }
