        "The Wildkeeper Camp": {
          "description": "A Wildkeeper forward camp pitched on a defensible rise - a ring of lean-tos and a longhouse of green logs behind a low palisade, with a watch-platform up in the crown of an old oak. This is where those who hunt the crusaders rest, treat their wounds, and trade word of where the Bloodsworn struck last and which way the war-bands moved. Wildkeepers hold it, but they are not the only ones who shelter here - rangers, hunters, and others with cause to fight the crusaders come and go.",
