        "The Broken Slopes": {
          "description": "Hilly forest where the ground rucks up into limestone ridges and outcrops, the trees thinning over bare grey stone. Cave-mouths and sinkholes pock the slopes, some no wider than a badger's hole, some big enough to walk into and lose the daylight. Game-trails and harder-worn paths wind between the rocks.",
