          "description": "A cave-system in the heart of the slopes, worked over by long use into something between a den and a strongroom - mouths worn smooth, soot black on the rock above old fire-scars, hide-scraps and rope and refuse trodden into the floor. The passages open into chambers off the dark, the larger ones bearing the marks of being lived in and fought over. Deeper galleries run back beyond where the smoke-stain reaches, into rock left alone.",
