        "The Stonetome": {
          "description": "A great hollow stalactite carved into a walkable history of the dark-elf people. Visitors enter at the top, where dioramas cut from living stone begin with the one elven kingdom whole. The path spirals down through the Kindred War, the high elves' Betrayal, and the Sundering that cast the dark elves out. At the bottom comes the Exodus, the dark elves descending into the earth, and then the passage opens onto the Lakeshore and the glittering city they built to prove the surface wrong.",
