        "The Dead Spring": {
          "description": "The hollow at the center of the town, where the hot spring once rose and kept the cold off. The pool is a plug of black ice now, the stonework around it sheathed in frost, the bathhouse and gathering-hall that ringed it standing dark and iced. The cold is hardest here.",
          "paths": [
