        "The Warg Crags": {
          "description": "The glen's upper end breaks into a steep tumble of grey scree and split rock, riddled with clefts and low caves. Bones lie scattered among the stones — cracked, gnawed, dragged. From the high shelves the whole glen lies open to view, the herd's lanes and the droveways small below. The footing is loose and treacherous, and a slip starts a slide. Cold air moves down out of the dark openings in the rock.",
          "paths": [
