        },
        "The Lower Galleries": {
          "description": "The crowded base of the library: marble colonnades, shelf-canyons, stairheads, and bridges stacked in every direction. Students hurry through with books under both arms while statues at the turnings point the lost toward the shelf, stair, or reading-court they need.",
          "paths": [
