        "The Camp": {
          "description": "A sprawl of huts and tents and shelters built from wrecked boats, crowded between the landing and the fort. Cookfires and a long drinking-shed stand at its middle, with stacks of plunder under awnings nearby. Tracks run up to the fort and down to the boats.",
