          "description": "Open heath rolling to the horizon, set all over with grass-grown burial mounds and the odd ring of standing stones. Some lie sealed, others stand broken open where they have been dug into. A worked excavation scars one stretch of the field, and a track leads off toward the largest mound of all.",
