        "The Feast-Hall": {
          "description": "A long feast-hall down the middle of the fortress, ranged with trestle tables and a great hearth, ale-casks along one wall. Banners hang from the rafters and trophies of famous undead kills crowd the stone. Galard's altar stands at the head, where oaths are sworn, fallen knights named, completed rides recounted, promotions acclaimed, and personal banners first raised. A board beside it carries standing hunts against the dead.",
          "paths": [
