        "The Reedways": {
          "description": "A maze of narrow channels and low mud islands winding back into the marsh. Reed blinds and stilt-platforms stand over the water, snare-lines are strung across the gaps, and pens of stake and rope sit on the firmer ground. Sightlines are short and the channels easy to lose.",
