        "The Lure": {
          "description": "An old stone lighthouse at the island's seaward point, standing on a spur of rock the reef has all but cut off from the rest of Falselight — reachable by a tidal causeway of slick black stone that the sea covers at the high water. The tower leans, weed-grown to the gallery, its door long gone.",
          "paths": [
            "The Wrackers' Holt"
          ]
        }
