      "hiddenInfo": "IMPORTANT: The sea-trolls are hostile by default and do not parley. They attack anything that moves on or near the skerries.\n\nThe trolls attack from the water first, tipping boats and pulling swimmers under, then dragging them ashore. On land they are slower, hulking, and stupid, but very strong. They keep captives alive in their dens for days or weeks against future hunger, which is why rescue crews put out from the hub whenever a ship goes missing near the skerries — there is usually still someone to save.\n\nLoot: the dens hold wreck cargo piled by the trolls — chests, casks, weapons, coin, and the belongings of the eaten. Troll grease, rendered from a dead troll, is the base of alchemical burn-salves and sells well to any alchemist. Sea-troll hide, once fire-scarred, no longer regrows and can be worked into tough armor.",
