        "The Flagship": {
          "description": "The great hulk at the anchorage's heart, upright on a bar with her decks above water. Claw-scored rails, gnawed timber, and heaped wreckage-nests crowd her upper decks. Below, burned companionways descend past silt-choked cabins into the dark of her stern.",
          "paths": [
            "The Burned Line"
          ]
        }
