        "The Wardroom": {
          "description": "The stern castle, built for officers three times too grand for the present age — high brass ceilings, tall windows over the shoals, and a chart table the size of a longboat scattered with rutters and soundings. The looking-glass is mounted at the south windows, trained on Manywrecks. One wall carries the contract board: rescue postings, escort work, and standing bounties.",
