        "The Berth Deck": {
          "description": "The long covered deck below, ports open for light and air. A galley amidships with fires always lit, a bar built across the bow under a mounted sea-serpent skull, an outfitter's cage racked with arms and gear, and bunks in rows down both sides. Carved wooden panels and flags off wrecked ships dress the brass walls. The drink of the house is whatever the last ship in carried.",
