      "basicInfo": "A human man of twenty-two with a lean, athletic build, warm fair skin, thick chestnut hair falling loosely across his forehead, and hazel eyes. He has a straight nose, a well-defined mouth, and a clean-shaven face.\n\nPrince Lucan belongs to Carendon’s royal family. A familiar presence at court celebrations, fencing matches, and hunting parties, he brings new acquaintances into fashionable company and welcomes companions for outings beyond the capital.",
