      "basicInfo": "He is a young human man with a lean build, warm brown skin, hazel eyes, an expressive broad mouth, and thick chestnut curls cut short around his face. He wears a wine-red wool waistcoat over a cream linen shirt, fitted dark trousers, and a well-cut green traveling coat; a narrow arming sword hangs in a plain leather scabbard at his hip.\n\nHe owns the White Wheel and knows Fallsmeet's Games, workshops, visitors, and roads. He can identify credible rumors, explain local rivalries and sponsorships, arrange transport or hired help, introduce newcomers to useful people, and surface opportunities suited to an adventurer's skills.",
