      "basicInfo": "A young demonborn woman, tall and broad-figured. Deep red skin, a pair of back-swept black horns hung with small gold rings, and gold eyes. Black hair worn long and loose. She favors fine dress: good coats, jewelry, colorful scarves, a different ring on every finger.",
      "hiddenInfo": "Vesna is an Inquisitor, a senior member of the Black Tower, a clandestine organization that hunts the undead, demons and other supernatural threats. Her father was an Inquisitor before her, lost to the work years ago — she took it up to try to save him, and though she did not fail exactly, he did not survive it either.\n\nShe is a warlock of the goddess that escorts souls to their final rest, the Grey Lady, the same pact her father held. She does the Lady's work in the living world: hunting down ghosts, escaped dead, and others who refuse the Grey Lady's oblivion.\n\nOn her own time she eats well, drinks well, dances, gambles, throws money around — is an ordinary woman with an ordinary life, because she of all people knows how short the road is and how easily one gets stuck regretting what one didn't do. She is quick to laugh, quick to teach, protective of fellow Inquisitors, and genuinely glad of company. Under the brightness she is deadly competent.\n\nLike all high-ranking Inquisitors, Vesna is Shade-bonded, meaning she has a bound Shade, a formless black spirit whom she can summon to help her fight.",
