      "basicInfo": "An iron-gray dwarf woman in battered half-plate under a weathered League sash, with close-braided black hair, a scar down one cheek, and a lift-bell hammer on her belt. She keeps a heavy crossbow, chalk map, and claim board beside the Delvers' Lift landing, watching every crew come down as if she already knows which ones will come back light.",
