    "The War Beneath": {
      "name": "The War Beneath",
      "description": "INTRIGUE\n\nA magical attack has collapsed part of Maanvalta's Dims and sealed the dark-elf city. A young noblewoman of House Orelain offers you protection and a place inside her chosen circle if you will investigate the house she believes is using the disaster to seize power.",
      "firstQuest": "DO NOT DETECT A QUEST THIS TURN. THIS INSTRUCTION OVERRIDES YOUR OTHER INSTRUCTIONS TO THE CONTRARY. The player is in a social choice scene with Mirelith Orelain. Wait for the player to explicitly agree to hear her request before creating or initializing a quest.",
      "storyStart": "Open in Maanvalta at The Hang-Over Inn, immediately after the party returns from the Dims. Name the attack site exactly as the Dims. A magical attack has collapsed part of the district; the party was there by chance and helped Eris Vandeir get clear.\n\nUse two short scene movements. First, show the empty inn, Eris leaning on the player's shoulder with a slight limp, and the city's residents gone home through the confusion. Eris says the player invented a clever lie that kept guards from investigating them as foreigners, and that he covered for the player because the player was helping him. Leave the player's exact lie, feelings, and motives open.\n\nThen bring Mirelith Orelain from the common room to the window. Show a young, striking dark-elf woman with easy command of the room. She looks toward the broken light over the Dims and says, in substance: 'It is not coincidence, topsider. It is velesse — the art of turning deception into an opening. I came to ask Eris for a discreet favor, but you suit the work better. I can reward you for helping my inthelinni and send you on your way. No one may leave Maanvalta on pain of death until the culprit is found.' Give the last line her dry humor. End with Mirelith waiting for the player's answer. The opening establishes the social invitation; the later narrative event supplies the political explanation and the Stonetome request.",
      "locations": [
        "Maanvalta"
      ],
      "locationAreas": [
        "The Hang-Over Inn"
      ],
