      "name": "Greater Turning Ward",
      "description": "Name fire, frost, shadow, or poison and draw a warding circle around the shadows of your whole company. The line rises and breaks into matching sigils that settle over every breast. Everyone in the company resists the named harm until the ward breaks, the danger passes, or you move on. This replaces any Turning Ward already protecting them.",
