    "Berserker": {
      "name": "Berserker",
      "description": "Main Attributes: Strength and Constitution\n\nBerserkers turn danger into motion. They learn to enter and steer a battle-fury that carries them through pain, fear, and exhaustion without taking away their judgment. In a fight, a berserker is the one who closes the distance, breaks the line, drags an ally clear with one hand, and keeps moving while the body is still deciding whether it is hurt.\n\nFury is physical discipline and instinct, not spellcraft. Some individual berserkers also practice blood rites, spirit-binding, or other magic, but none of these are required by the class. The good ones know when to let fury loose, where to drive it, and how much the body will owe when it ends.",
