    "Bard": {
      "name": "Bard",
      "description": "Main Attributes: Attunement and Charisma\n\nBards are specialists in attention, mood, story, and access. A good bard can turn a room before anyone admits the room has turned: a song at the right time, a joke that lands too sharply, a rumor carried to the right ear, a silence that makes everyone lean in. Performance is their craft, but the real talent is knowing what people want to believe and giving it shape.\n\nBards move through taverns, courts, camps, ships, guildhalls, underworld dens, and noble salons because people open doors for entertainment, gossip, comfort, and spectacle. That access is power. A bard can lift allies, expose fools, start trouble, end trouble, and make a dangerous moment follow their tempo long enough to matter.\n\nSpecial Starting Gear: Maple Lute",
