    "Blood Dancer": {
      "name": "Blood Dancer",
      "description": "Main Attributes: Attunement, Constitution, and Dexterity\n\nBlood dancers turn bloodletting, pulse, pain, and blade-work into a disciplined fighting art. Their scars are practiced channels that make fresh blood easier to focus, clot, read, and spend. They learn to open themselves for sudden power, leave a foe’s wound working after the blade has passed, and draw that failing strength back into their own body.\n\nThe style is acrobatic, intimate, and costly. A good blood dancer knows what each cut buys, when to let a wound keep bleeding, when to take its power, and when the price in their own body has become too high.\n\nSpecial Starting Gear: Red-Jade Bloodchannel Dagger.",
