    "Hammerdwarf": {
      "name": "Hammerdwarf",
      "description": "Main Attributes: Strength and Intelligence\n\nHammerdwarves are armored warriors who fight the way dwarves build — heavy, precise, and methodical. They know how things are put together, which makes them very good at taking things apart.",
