      "traitNarrativeEffects": "A ranger belongs in the wilds. They read tracks, weather, cover, water, animal sign, patrol habits, routes, and terrain, and understand the needs and temperaments of wild beasts. In new country, occasionally establish a distinctive local beast through its signs before the encounter; it may be hunted, avoided, aided, calmed, trained, or befriended according to its nature. A beast that comes to lasting trust may choose to travel with the ranger as a companion."
