    "Rogue": {
      "name": "Rogue",
      "description": "Main Attribute: Dexterity\n\nRogues are specialists in attention, access, timing, and exits. They notice the loose latch, the bored guard, the false smile, the loaded purse, the hidden pocket, the crowded doorway, and the one second when everyone looks somewhere else. Some are thieves, spies, burglars, smugglers, assassins, scouts, or professional problem-solvers, but the shared talent is simple: get in, get what matters, and get out with the room still arguing about what happened.\n\nA rogue does not need the cleanest fight or the honest path. They need a blind spot, a useful lie, a misplaced key, a moving crowd, a hand already in motion, or an exit nobody else counted. In Larion's cities, ruins, courts, underworlds, and locked places, that skill set opens doors steel cannot break and survives dangers armor cannot solve.\n\nSpecial Starting Gear: Loaded Dice",
