    "Warlock": {
      "name": "Warlock",
      "description": "Main Attributes: Attunement, Intelligence, and Charisma\n\nWarlocks hold power through a living pact with a patron beyond the mortal world. The bargain may be written, sworn, inherited, stolen, misunderstood, or struck in desperation. It grants specific powers through signs, servants, hexes, summonings, sudden doors, and other workings marked by the patron.\n\nA warlock's existing powers are settled clauses of the bargain, not a new negotiation each time they are used. A practiced warlock learns to call on those powers cleanly, read what the patron wants, find leverage, and negotiate new clauses without yielding more than they intend.\n\nSpecial Starting Gear: Pact Token",
