    "Wizard": {
      "name": "Wizard",
      "description": "Main Attributes: Attunement and Intelligence\n\nWizards are the people who learned how magic is built, then learned where to put pressure until it obeys. No bloodline gift, no patron's bargain: just hard-won technique, exact hands, prepared marks, and the nerve to use them under threat. A good wizard does not merely throw fire. They read the shape of a curse, cut a summoning loose, fold a ward into a cuff, and turn a bad battlefield into a problem they have already solved.\n\nTheir tools are spellbooks, chalk, thread, ink, rings, diagrams, and memorized names, but the point is not study for its own sake. The point is control. Wizardry in Larion is precise, dangerous work practiced in academies, towers, courts, ruins, and on roads where theory has to survive teeth, steel, weather, and hostile magic.\n\nSpecial Starting Gear: Traveling Spellbook, two sheets of Prepared Vellum, and a Scroll of the White Comet.",
