    "Sorcerer": {
      "name": "Sorcerer",
      "description": "Main Attributes: Attunement and Intelligence\n\nSorcerers carry magic inside the body before they ever learn what to call it. Its origin may be an inheritance, curse, old ritual, magical accident, strange birth, or mystery no one has answered, but it is not borrowed and it is not built from notes. It lives in breath, temper, pulse, skin, voice, and instinct. Training teaches a sorcerer how not to burn down the room every time fear or anger reaches for the power.\n\nThat rawness is both gift and danger. A sorcerer can release power faster than a careful caster can prepare for it, shape a surge into something useful, and survive moments where the magic almost gets away. The best ones are not calm because the power is gentle. They are calm because they have learned exactly how much of themselves to let out.",
