    "Mark of Rhadan": {
      "name": "Mark of Rhadan",
      "description": "You have been accepted into the Shadow Inquisition at the Black Tower in Drusavia. The Mark of Rhadan is the order's oath-mark, carried by Initiates as well as full Inquisitors. It identifies you to the Tower and anchors you to the living world during authorized contact with the Shadelands, but it does not by itself make you Shade-Bonded or grant full Inquisitor rank.",
