      "name": "Path of the Cloak",
      "description": "You are trained in quiet work: moving unseen, opening what is locked, scouting danger, following without being seen, reading exits, handling secrets, and wearing a false face when needed. This path covers thieves, spies, scouts, infiltrators, trap-breakers, rebel couriers, noble agents, guild hands, and careful survivors.\n\nTo become a Novice of the Cloak, find a suitable contact or patron, take a small quiet job, return with proof, and show that you can work with discretion.",
