    "Novice of the Blade": {
      "name": "Novice of the Blade",
      "description": "You have deliberately tested your weapon discipline under genuine danger and fulfilled the feat exactly as you vowed it. Fear, resistance, and consequence are no longer abstractions to you.\n\nBenefit: +5 maximum stamina.\n\nTo pursue Adept rank, first vow a concrete feat that explicitly names Adept of the Blade as the rank you seek and demonstrates a named martial technique or controlled result against capable resistance. Declare the technique, a meaningful constraint, and a clear success condition before attempting it. For example, swear to take a weapon from a veteran without drawing blood, or defeat a shield fighter without yielding the center of a marked circle.",
