      "name": "Expert of the Vessel",
      "description": "You have controlled difficult magic through serious opposition or strain while preserving what you vowed to protect. Your capacity is expressed through discipline: pressure can rise without deciding the shape of the working for you.\n\nBenefits: +10 maximum mana, Seat the Working, and Wear the Working. You may spend a level-up trait pick on one permanent Expert specialization: Discipline of the Anchor, Discipline of the Conduit, or Discipline of the Crucible. Each specialization unlocks one defining technique that may be purchased with ability points.\n\nTo pursue Master rank, first vow a large, complex, or opposed magical capstone that explicitly names Master of the Vessel as the rank you seek. Declare the exceptional stakes, an exacting limit on control or harm, and a decisive success condition worthy of a life's discipline. For example, swear to bind a raging ley rupture before dawn without letting its force take a life or permanently scar the surrounding land.",
