    "plant creature": {
      "name": "plant creature",
      "description": "The hostile green: shriekers and violet fungi, choking vines, and vegetation monsters. The fungal kit is the cave's alarm and its ambush — shriekers scream light and movement to the dark garden's hunters. Rooted logic governs: territory is absolute, patience is infinite, and nothing rooted ever chases — the horror is realizing how long you have been inside its reach. Treants and dryads are not plant creatures; they belong to the fey and the old wild. In combat: entangle, constrict, and spore (impact, poison); psychic assault means nothing to them (resist); fire is the terror and the answer (vulnerability); blades cut poorly (piercing resist).",
