    "grell_ratkin_courier": {
      "title": "News from Greenmeadow",
      "targetTurns": 2,
      "beats": "A ratkin courier tracks the party down wherever they are. Do not assign the courier a permanent NPC object or require a particular tavern, lift, or hub; stage the encounter in the party's current scene at a natural pause, with the courier arriving breathless and intent on being heard. The courier says a Messenger Owl carried fresh news from Greenmeadow.\n\nThe report is concrete: tremors under the village, water vibrating in wells and troughs, livestock frightened, burrowing animals fleeing their holes, birds abandoning the fields, and a low grinding that can be felt before it can be heard. The courier explains what the League has learned about the kobolds' Big Buzzer: a Fourth Empire artifact that emits directional ground-vibrations, attracts and irritates stone-boring beetles, and turns them violently destructive. It does not control the beetles.\n\nThis is the actionable report, not a separate warning scene at Greenmeadow. Complete the event once the party understands that a breach is imminent or opening and can choose to go there.",
      "onCompleteEffects": [
        {
          "type": "write-boolean",
          "key": "grell_courier_pending",
          "operator": "set",
