    "dq_briefing_astarieth": {
      "title": "Dragon Queen Briefing: Astarieth",
      "targetTurns": 1,
      "beats": "Continue the briefing with Astarieth the Risen.\n\nRennick names Astarieth as another Harbinger and the holder of another Seal fragment. She rules the closed Reedmoot Fens from Astarieth's Court, a half-sunken ruin where old imperial halls stand in black water.\n\nAlayne explains what makes her hard to reach. Astarieth was once a priestess and is now a vast mire dragon, served by priest-kings, lizardfolk war-parties, brood-pools, and made drakes bred to guard the approaches. Her servants have closed the fens around her and turned the drowned city into a dragon kingdom.\n\nMake the path clear in the briefing: reach the Reedmoot Fens, find a way into Astarieth's Court, break through Astarieth's servants and brood-guards, confront Astarieth, and recover her Seal fragment.\n\nEnd the beat with a clear handoff that one Harbinger remains to be named, Ophialtha, Beast of the Deeps.",
