    "dq_briefing_ophialtha": {
      "title": "Dragon Queen Briefing: Ophialtha",
      "targetTurns": 1,
      "beats": "Continue the briefing with Ophialtha, Beast of the Deeps.\n\nRennick names Ophialtha as another Harbinger and the holder of another Seal fragment. She is the sea-dragon threat in the Seadeep Kingdoms, choking ships and coasts until surface folk and sea folk are forced into war with one another.\n\nAlayne explains where she waits. Ophialtha lairs in the Drowned City of Orichala, a sunken ruin whose deepest dome still holds air, jungle, and old magic beneath the sea. She commands predators, sea-serpents, and servants in the waters around it, and a fight with her happens on deep-water terms.\n\nMake the path clear in the briefing: survive the sea war around Orichala, enter the drowned ruins, reach Ophialtha's deep lair, defeat her there, and recover her Seal fragment.\n\nEnd the beat with a clear handoff back to Ardan's Watch and the first assignment: before anyone can reach Draelkharion, the Pyre altar beneath Muckside has to be found and broken.",
