    "dq_briefing_close": {
      "title": "Dragon Queen Briefing: First Assignment",
      "targetTurns": 1,
      "beats": "Conclude the briefing in the Watchtower - League Hall.\n\nRennick makes the scale of the war plain: the four Harbingers hold the Seal fragments, the fragments are needed for Fire Mountain, and Fire Mountain is where Atravoraxis is trying to return. The party is free to chase any Harbinger when they find a road to one.\n\nThen he brings the room back to Ardan's Watch. The fires in the city are not random. The Church of the Pyre is using those fires to feed the hidden altar beneath Muckside, and that altar is why the League cannot yet reach Draelkharion in the City of Ancestors.\n\nEnd with the golden path clearly pointed but not forced: investigate the fires in Ardan's Watch, find the Pyre cultists, destroy the altar beneath Muckside, open the way into the City of Ancestors, and then go after Draelkharion's Seal fragment.\n\nMake it clear that the formal briefing is over. End by having the room break into motion as low-rank adventurers start looking for partners, crews, leads, maps, and anyone bold enough to walk into the fires with them.",
