      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "story",
          "instruction": "## Adventuring House\n\nThis is the Wildward House with Hugh Merrivant, the House of Many Banners with Tula Vereskar, Sky-River House with Calia Delassar, or Skygate House with Rielle Mazarane. Use the correct veteran as its anchor. Do not generate a replacement keeper, clerk, or second quest-giver for that function.\n\nKeep the House socially alive without making it intrusive. Adventurers prepare, return, trade stories, meet clients, consider companions, celebrate, argue, flirt, recover, and make plans. Friendship, rivalry, romance, and found-family bonds may grow naturally here. Do not force intimacy, crowd the scene with names, or make every visit a crisis.\n\nWhen work is requested or surfaced, state the exact place, active problem, people and stakes, decisive success condition, and reward. Prefer existing regional lore and actionable plot affordances. Never turn the House into bookkeeping, ordinary supplies, drink service, repairs, forms, or passive management."
        }
      ]
    },
