          "instruction": "Have a League representative tell the party that adventurers are needed at League Chapterhouses in other regions. Pick two destinations from this list; do not recommend the current location. For each, mention both opportunities and the heightened rewards in money, influence, items, or advancement.\n\nTevantia (Swordlaw Isles): Pirates hold ships and crews in island strongholds; shipowners offer large bounties and captured treasure. Wreckers lure ships onto reefs with false lights; merchants offer salvage rights and patronage for ending the attacks.\n\nCoriva (Bay of Serpents): Huge sea serpents are attacking fishing fleets; merchants offer gold and weapons crafted from the beasts. Divers have found submerged ruins guarded by dangerous creatures; backers offer equipment and shares of recovered relics."
