          "type": "story",
          "instruction": "More League Chapterhouse destinations:\n\nWarmwater Township (Aurora): Ice drakes are hunting between isolated settlements; northern leaders offer large bounties and enchanted hunting gear. Expeditions have vanished in the frozen ruins of a lost kingdom; rescuers can claim rewards and recovered treasure.\n\nOasis (Dunelands): Tomb-raiders need help overcoming the guardians of dead Sun Kings; backers offer shares of sun-gold and enchanted grave-goods. A cult is gathering relics to raise those kings; desert nobles offer rich payments and magical equipment for stopping it.\n\nDrusavia (Duchy of Drusavia): Wealthy families want estates cleared of the old vampire lords' undead servants; rewards include gold and use of restored properties. People are disappearing near secluded noble estates; their families offer rich rewards and court introductions for bringing them home."
        },
        {
          "type": "story",
          "instruction": "More League Chapterhouse destinations:\n\nSanctuary (Sanctuary Vale): Bandits and renegade elves hold captives in forest strongholds; merchants offer large rescue bounties. Magical beasts are being trapped and sold in the city; druids offer enchanted gifts and forest allies for freeing them and exposing the buyers.\n\nDun Solas (Highheath): Trolls have seized mountain bridges and cut off trade; dwarves offer huge bounties and fine arms. Gangs are stealing enchanted weapons; their makers offer custom equipment and Trade Guild influence for recovering them."
        }
      ]
