      "script": "const TENANTS = ['strigoi', 'ferals', 'raiders', 'ghouls']\nconst tick = check({ type: 'game-tick' }) || 0\nconst clears = storage.hc_clears || 0\nconst last = typeof storage.hc_last_cleared_tick === 'number' ? storage.hc_last_cleared_tick : -400\nconst pressure = tick - last\nconst band = pressure < 50 ? 'regrouping' : (pressure < 150 ? 'settled' : 'entrenched')\nconst idx = band === 'regrouping'\n  ? (clears + TENANTS.length - 1) % TENANTS.length\n  : clears % TENANTS.length\nconst tenant = TENANTS[idx]\nstorage.hc_on_site = true\nstorage.hc_tenant = tenant\nstorage.hc_band = band\nstorage.hc_last_node = 'combat'\nstorage.hc_depth = 0\nstorage.hc_visits = (storage.hc_visits || 0) + 1\nstorage.hc_keeper_cleared_this_visit = false\neffects.push({ type: 'write-boolean', key: 'hc_on_site', operator: 'set', value: true })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-string', key: 'hc_tenant', operator: 'set', value: tenant })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-string', key: 'hc_band', operator: 'set', value: band })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-string', key: 'hc_last_node', operator: 'set', value: 'combat' })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-number', key: 'hc_depth', operator: 'set', value: 0 })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-boolean', key: 'hc_keeper_cleared_this_visit', operator: 'set', value: false })\nconst ARRIVAL = {\n    'strigoi': 'Strigoi hold the complex: mindless, wall-crawling, sluggish while daylight lasts and fierce once it does not. They have denned in the cells the place was built to hold them in. They do not parley, ever.',\n    'ferals': 'A Ferals pack holds the complex — werewolves and beast-shifters who took the curse willingly. They post watches, they hold ground, and they can talk, which makes them the only tenants up here that can be bargained with or lied to. Silver and moonstone bite them.',\n    'raiders': 'People hold the complex: outlaws, deserters, or a Crimson Company crew that went bad. They are organized, armed, and negotiable, they know what a cull is worth, and they may be holding somebody off the terraces.',\n    'ghouls': 'Ghouls hold the complex, come down from Charnel Mountain in numbers. No tactics, no leader worth the name until you reach the one that is bigger than the rest, and they have dug into the lower cells.',\n  }\nconst BAND = {\n    'regrouping': 'The party has come back quickly, and it is the same lot as last time: survivors, scavengers, and whatever crawled back. Thin on the ground, badly organized, and there is little here worth carrying out. Say so plainly — the Company does not pay for this.',\n    'settled': 'They have been in a few months. Dens established, the outworks watched, some of the complex\\'s own gates worked out and put back into use, and a stock of what they have taken off the roads.',\n    'entrenched': 'They have been in there a long time and they are dug in. The outworks are held, the keeper stations are theirs, they have learned the gates and the drops and will use both, and they are raiding the terraces well enough that Velmere is counting its losses.',\n  }\neffects.push({ type: 'story', instruction: 'Establish who holds The High Caves this visit, before anything else. ' + ARRIVAL[tenant] + ' ' + BAND[band] + ' Use these occupiers and only these for the whole visit.' })\neffects.push({ type: 'narrative-event-start', eventId: 'hc_arrival_gate' })",
