        {
          "type": "action",
          "query": "The party moves deeper into The High Caves or commits to new ground inside them: they advance, press on, push deeper, descend, force or unlock a gate or grille, cut a chain, work a counterweight, clear a fall, cross a drop, breach a barricade, follow a corridor or cell row, scout ahead, search beyond the current chamber, pursue someone inward, or head toward the Cells or the Unmapped. This is NOT satisfied when the party withdraws toward the outworks or the slope, holds position, rests, tends wounds, talks among themselves, manages gear or loot, or interacts only with what is already in front of them."
