      "script": "const tenant = storage.hc_tenant || 'strigoi'\nconst COMBAT = {\n    'strigoi': 'Stage a fight now with strigoi physically on scene and acting. Vary the mix: do not repeat the composition or tactics of the previous fight this visit. Fresh ones are fast, whole, and stupid; old ones are grey, elongated, near-silent, and come along ceilings and through grilles. Match the party\\'s numbers: at least one per party member, or one old strigoi plus support. Use the complex — silvered grilles, counterweight gates, murder-slots, drops cut across the floor, and the daylight line. They never parley and do not fear death, but they can be baited, funnelled, and shut behind iron.',\n    'ferals': 'Stage a fight now with the Ferals pack physically on scene and acting. Vary the mix: do not repeat the composition or tactics of the previous fight this visit. They fight as a pack with roles — drivers, flankers, one that hangs back and calls it — and they use the complex deliberately, holding junctions and working the gates. Match the party\\'s numbers. Silver and moonstone hurt them and they know it and will target whoever carries it. They can shout, threaten, offer terms, and break off; some will run rather than die, and a broken pack scatters instead of fighting to the last.',\n    'raiders': 'Stage a fight now with the raiders physically on scene and acting. Vary the mix: do not repeat the composition or tactics of the previous fight this visit. These are people with a plan — sentries, crossbows from the murder-slots, a barricade at a junction, someone shouting orders and someone else deciding whether to obey. Match the party\\'s numbers. They can be talked to, bought, split, or frightened off, and they take prisoners and surrender when it is clearly over. Killing them all is a choice, not the only outcome.',\n    'ghouls': 'Stage a fight now with ghouls physically on scene and acting. Vary the mix: do not repeat the composition or tactics of the previous fight this visit. They come in numbers and in flocks, without tactics, boiling up out of the lower cells and through the drops, and a ghast among them staggers people with its stench. Match the party\\'s numbers generously — this tenant is about being outnumbered in a corridor. Use chokepoints, gates, and fire. They do not parley and they do not stop.',\n  }\neffects.push({ type: 'story', instruction: 'The party is committing to new ground in The High Caves. ' + COMBAT[tenant] + ' Do not substitute tracks, sounds, or warnings for the encounter itself. If an authored scene is already underway, fold this into it rather than opening a second front.' })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-string', key: 'hc_last_node', operator: 'set', value: 'combat' })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-number', key: 'hc_depth', operator: 'add', value: 1 })",
