      "script": "const tenant = storage.hc_tenant || 'strigoi'\nconst PAYOFF = {\n    'strigoi': 'Pay it off with the keepers\\' own caches, which strigoi cannot use and have never touched: silvered gear, restraint tackle, a keeper\\'s kit still in its bracket. Use exact catalogue names such as Moonstone Dagger of Radiant, Silver Binding Chain, Silver-Tipped Bolts of Radiance, Iron Shortsword, or Leather Jerkin. Add the effects of people who did not come home — a purse of 10 to 40 florins, a signet, a name worth carrying back down.',\n    'ferals': 'Pay it off with what the pack has taken off the roads and the terraces: coin in the 20 to 60 florin range, a merchant\\'s strongbox forced open, trophies, and good gear stripped from people who lost it. Use exact catalogue names such as Iron Shortsword, Leather Jerkin, Light Crossbow, Crossbow Bolts, or Stamina Draught. Add one keeper cache they could not open or would not touch, holding silver or moonstone.',\n    'raiders': 'Pay it off with a crew\\'s takings: a strongbox, 30 to 80 florins, stolen stock and goods with Velmere marks still on them, and their own kit. Use exact catalogue names such as Iron Shortsword, Fine Steel Shortsword, Light Crossbow, Crossbow Bolts, Leather Jerkin, or Mongo\\'s Medium Health Potion. Papers, a ledger, or a name they were working for is worth as much as the coin.',\n    'ghouls': 'Pay it off with what has been dug up and dragged in: grave-goods, chewed purses totalling 10 to 40 florins, and the keepers\\' old caches the ghouls have broken into but could not carry. Use exact catalogue names such as Moonstone Dagger of Radiant, Silver Binding Chain, Iron Dagger, or Stamina Draught. Silver from Charnel turns up here too, in bar or in coin.',\n  }\neffects.push({ type: 'story', instruction: 'The party has just resolved something in The High Caves. Pay it off now with a concrete find tied to the immediate place. ' + PAYOFF[tenant] + ' Name what they find. Then telegraph one thing deeper: a