      "script": "const tick = check({ type: 'game-tick' }) || 0\nconst tenant = storage.hc_tenant || 'strigoi'\nconst PRIZE = {\n    'strigoi': 'Deliver the clear: the pack breaks once its oldest is down. Pay out a keeper\\'s arsenal cache from the Unmapped, itemized — Moonstone Dagger of Radiant, Silver Binding Chain, Silver-Tipped Bolts of Radiance — plus 40 to 90 florins gathered off six generations of the dead.',\n    'ferals': 'Deliver the clear: the pack scatters or submits once its leader is beaten. Pay out their war-chest, itemized — 60 to 120 florins, a Vampire Hunter\\'s Crossbow taken off somebody who came hunting them, good gear, and trophies worth naming — plus one keeper cache from the Unmapped they never got into.',\n    'raiders': 'Deliver the clear: the crew surrenders, breaks, or is put down once its captain is beaten. Pay out the strongbox, itemized — 80 to 150 florins, Fine Steel Shortsword, Mongo\\'s Medium Health Potion, stolen Velmere goods to return — plus their papers, which name who was buying from them.',\n    'ghouls': 'Deliver the clear: the flock disperses once the ghast is destroyed. Pay out what the diggings turned up, itemized — 40 to 90 florins, Silver Binding Chain, Moonstone Dagger of Radiant, silver in bar from Charnel — plus a keeper\\'s cache the ghouls opened and could not carry.',\n  }\nstorage.hc_clears = (storage.hc_clears || 0) + 1\nstorage.hc_last_cleared_tick = tick\nstorage.hc_keeper_cleared_this_visit = true\neffects.push({ type: 'write-boolean', key: 'hc_keeper_cleared_this_visit', operator: 'set', value: true })\nif (storage.bloodMember === true) { storage.bloodDeedCreditPending = true }\neffects.push({ type: 'story', instruction: 'The High Caves are cleared for now. ' + PRIZE[tenant] + ' Then close it honestly: the complex is not sealed and cannot be. Cold air still moves out of the Unmapped, and both the party and the Company know something will be back in here. If the party holds a Crimson Company writ, this is work an officer will pay and credit for once they hear the account.' })",
