e mark, which is the part that matters. The lord the party serves \\u2014 Lady Isaveau, if they have been working Velmere \\u2014 sets a mark on them personally, and it is done in her presence, not sent down. From now on vampires of the Shadow Summits can see whose these people are and will not feed on them. Let somebody present make clear, warmly or otherwise, that the mark says property as much as it says protection. Redblade work is the houses\\' own business now, not valley culls.' })\n}",
