      "script": "const tick = check({ type: 'game-tick' }) || 0\nconst last = typeof storage.chm_last_thinned_tick === 'number' ? storage.chm_last_thinned_tick : -400\nconst pressure = tick - last\nconst band = pressure < 50 ? 'thinned' : (pressure < 150 ? 'pressing' : 'overflowing')\nstorage.chm_on_site = true\nstorage.chm_band = band\nstorage.chm_last_node = 'combat'\nstorage.chm_depth = 0\nstorage.chm_visits = (storage.chm_visits || 0) + 1\nstorage.chm_seam_worked_this_visit = false\neffects.push({ type: 'write-boolean', key: 'chm_on_site', operator: 'set', value: true })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-string', key: 'chm_band', operator: 'set', value: band })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-string', key: 'chm_last_node', operator: 'set', value: 'combat' })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-number', key: 'chm_depth', operator: 'set', value: 0 })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-boolean', key: 'chm_seam_worked_this_visit', operator: 'set', value: false })\nconst BANDS = {\n    'thinned': 'Somebody cleared the lower levels not long ago. The Headworks camp is busy and confident, the Upper Workings are workable, and the dead are mostly down deep where they belong. Good prospecting, thin fighting, and the Company is not paying for a thinning right now.',\n    'pressing': 'They are back up into the Upper Workings. Prospectors camp at the Headworks and do not go in alone or after dark, the tally of who has not come out is being kept out loud, and the old galleries have dead in them again.',\n    'overflowing': 'They are out of the mine mouth at night and down onto the slopes. The Headworks camp is half a siege — fires kept up, watches set, nobody sleeping well — the valleys nearest the mountain are losing people, and the lords have let it be known that somebody should go down and break the press.',\n  }\neffects.push({ type: 'story', instruction: 'Establish how hard the mountain is pressing this visit, before anything else. ' + BANDS[band] + ' There is no master here and no bargain to