      "script": "const area = check({ type: 'party-area' }) || 'The Upper Workings'\nconst COMBAT = {\n    'The Headworks': 'Stage a fight now, at or around the mine mouth. Ghouls that have come up and out: few, scattered, and scavenging among the gutted winch-houses and ore-sheds rather than hunting as a flock. Vary the mix and do not repeat the previous fight this visit. Match the party\\'s numbers. Use the ruined surface buildings, the spoil heaps, the open ground, and daylight if there is any. These are the ones bold enough to leave the dark, which makes them the worst of the shallow ones rather than the least.',\n    'The Upper Workings': 'Stage a fight now in the timber-shored galleries and ore-stopes. Ghouls hunting in small packs through the old workings, coming along the stopes and down the winzes, with a ghast among them if the press is on. Vary the mix and do not repeat the previous fight this visit. Match the party\\'s numbers. Use the ground: rotten shoring, spilled ore underfoot, abandoned picks, drops into worked-out stopes, and the fact that a blade in one hand means only one hand for the silver.',\n    'The Deep Diggings': 'Stage a fight now in the lowest levels, where the air goes foul and the timber rots. Ghouls in flocks rather than packs, boiling out of side workings and up through the bone-thick floor, with ghasts driving them and their stench staggering anyone close. Vary the mix and do not repeat the previous fight this visit. Match the party\\'s numbers generously: down here the danger is being outnumbered in a dead-end gallery. Use chokepoints, bad air, failing light, and fire. They do not parley and they do not stop.',\n  }\nconst instruction = COMBAT[area] || COMBAT['The Upper Workings']\neffects.push({ type: 'story', instruction: 'The party is committing to new ground in Charnel Mountain. ' + instruction + ' Do not substitute sign or sound for the encounter itself. If an authored scene is already underway, fold this into it rather than opening a second front.' })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-string', key: 'chm_last_node', operator: 'set', value: 'combat' })\neffects.push({ type: 'write-number', key: 'chm_depth', operator: 'add', value: 1 })",
