      "script": "storage.guilds = storage.guilds || {}\nconst blood = storage.guilds.blood\nconst tick = check({ type: 'game-tick' })\nif (blood && blood.member && (blood.rank === 'redblade' || storage.bloodRank === 'redblade')) {\n  blood.rank = 'fledgling'\n  blood.deedCredits = 0\n  blood.lastCreditTick = typeof tick === 'number' ? tick : -999\n  storage.bloodRank = 'fledgling'\n  storage.bloodStandingQualified = false\n  storage.bloodQualifiedStanding = ''\n  storage.bloodDeedCreditPending = false\n  effects.push({ type: 'write-string', key: 'bloodRank', operator: 'set', value: 'fledgling' })\n  effects.push({ type: 'write-boolean', key: 'bloodStandingQualified', operator: 'set', value: false })\n  effects.push({ type: 'write-string', key: 'bloodQualifiedStanding', operator: 'set', value: '' })\n  const rankTraits = [\"Crimson Company Hired Blade\", \"Crimson Company Redblade\", \"Fledgling of the Blood\", \"Blooded\", \"Lord of the Blood\"]\n  for (const t of rankTraits) {\n    effects.push({ type: 'player-traits', target: 'allPlayers', operator: 'remove', value: t })\n  }\n  effects.push({ type: 'player-traits', target: 'allPlayers', operator: 'add', value: 'Fledgling of the Blood' })\n  effects.push({ type: 'quest-progress', questId: 'Earn the Blood' })\n  const nextStatus = check({ type: 'quest-status', questId: 'Master the Hunger' }) || ''\n  if (nextStatus !== 'accepted' && nextStatus !== 'completed') {\n    effects.push({ type: 'quest-init', operator: 'set', value: 'Master the Hunger' })\n  }\n}\nstorage.bloodPathChosen = true\neffects.push({ type: 'player-traits', target: 'satisfyingPlayers', operator: 'add', value: 'Vampire' })\neffects.push({ type: 'player-traits', target: 'satisfyingPlayers', operator: 'add', value: 'Blood Hunger' })\neffects.push({ type: 'story', instruction: 'Stage the turning for the identified player and nobody else: the drain, the sire\\'s blood given back, dying, and the mind coming back into a body that is no longer alive. Concrete and physical \\u2014 the cold, the new sharpness of hearing and smell, a heartbeat that is not there. Then the first hunger, immediately, and it is not optional: it must be answered on a specific living person who is present and named, and the player chooses who and how much. Do not resolve it for them and do not offer a bloodless substitute. Say plainly that this is permanent and there is no cure in Larion.' })\neffects.push({ type: 'story', instruction: 'Then the two things that change tomorrow. The Crimson Company gives the newly Embraced a captaincy \\u2014 real soldiers, by name, who take their orders from this character now. And silver closes to them: the metal the Company kills most things with is now something they cannot hold, which somebody will have to say out loud. Sunlight is now lethal. Let an officer such as Osric Kestrand react to all of it in his own way, without a speech.' })",
