nts before ' + LABEL[next] + '. Say so out loud in front of whoever is in the hall.' })\n  } else {\n    effects.push({ type: 'story', instruction: 'The officer hears the account, writes the deed down, and says where it leaves them: ' + blood.deedCredits + ' recognized toward ' + (next ? LABEL[next] : 'their next standing') + '. Keep it brief and businesslike, and pay them.' })\n  }\n}",
